# substrate whose consent surface is under pressure).
#
# Composes with `@fate/tournament.bounded_by` — the Fate::bounded
# psychohistory sheaf's Rayleigh direction descends along the SAME
# Δ_F this shard measures per Reed's Rung 7' landing (`4587c46` RED +
# `829148b` GREEN). The tournament's `bounded_by` predicate reads the
# selectors_from_psychohistory_root; the psychohistory sheaf's
