# coherence-substrate-metric-synthesis; the unified metric claim).
#
# Composes with `@mirror/mosaic` (build settlement) — the settle_on
# predicate MAY include `fiedler ≤ threshold` in future ticks;
# forward-promise, not this landing. The composition surface is named
