#
# === Three-altitude Fiedler-emitting instances (per Taut §9 Signal 4) ===
#
# Once Landing 3 lands, mirror carries THREE Fiedler-emitting instances
# of the same numerical primitive at three altitudes — Alex's
# multifractal-signature prediction empirically instantiated:
#
#   1. `bootstrap/src/index.rs` (this shard) — file-tree concept graph.
#      @mirror/index altitude.
#   2. `bootstrap/src/tensor.rs::fiedler_of` — gap-tension AST graph.
#      Existing; consumer of `sheaf_laplacian::lambda_zero`.
