# f(α) spectrum matching Mandelbrot boundary signature.
#
# === Species / actions ===
#
# The primary discharge:
#
#   index(peer_home: ~d) -> eigenvalue_profile
#     Reads the file-tree, builds the concept graph, computes λ₀
#     via `sheaf_laplacian`, returns the top-16 eigenvalue profile
#     with the Fiedler value at index 1. Composes walk_detected +
#     build_concept_graph + eigenvalue_profile. The action-decl the
#     `mirror index <path>` CLI dispatcher (Landing 4) and the
#     `mirror_index` MCP tool (Landing 5) both discharge to.
